  "description": "Originally designed by frontier asteroid belt miners needing a broad, stable platform capable of maneuvering through dense tumbling debris fields, the Carcinus was aggressively refitted into a heavy skirmish cruiser. Featuring an extraordinarily wide, multi-segmented carapace and heavy forward pincer sponsons, its propulsion grid sacrifices conventional forward burn speed to achieve violent lateral vectoring."
